{
  "messages": [
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Take {gift_item}. May it keep trouble at a respectful distance.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Here, {gift_item}. Some blessings are practical enough to fit in a hand.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "Good. {tested_villager} received {gift_item} with the right spirit.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "Then the omen was clear. {gift_item} carried kindness where you took it.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Then I read the sign poorly. Bring {alternative_gift} to {gift_subject}; it should be received better.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Set {gift_item} aside for that soul. {alternative_gift} is the gentler offering.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Not every sign is kind. Offer {alternative_gift} next time.",
      "dispositions": [
        "cautious",
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "If {gift_item} troubled them, perhaps that was the lesson. {alternative_gift} will be calmer.",
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    }
  ],
  "openings": [
    {
      "id": "cleric_opening",
      "text": "Mind the brewing stand. What do you need?"
    }
  ],
  "closings": [
    {
      "id": "cleric_closing",
      "text": "Back to mixing remedies and prayers, then."
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "cleric_chat_remedies",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Some remedies need glass bottles. Some need time and a quieter voice.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_question_wounds",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "There are wounds that potions cannot mend.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_story_omens",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Bad omens linger longer than most people think.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_greeting_bottles",
      "type": "greeting",
      "text": "Mind the bottles. Some are medicine, some are mistakes I have not named yet.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_chat_brew",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "A good brew needs time, heat, and someone willing to wait quietly.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_question_omens",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "An omen is only useless if nobody changes course after seeing it.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_story_remedy",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "I once made a remedy so bitter the patient got better out of spite.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_joke_bitter",
      "type": "joke",
      "text": "A cleric joke is like medicine: if it tastes pleasant, check it twice.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_insult_empty",
      "type": "insult",
      "text": "That was an empty bottle of a thought.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_chat_wounds",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Some hurts close cleanly. Some wait for a quieter day.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_question_prayer",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Prayer is not a trade. You do not put in words and pull out certainty.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_story_night",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "After a hard night, even the brewing stand sounds tired in the morning.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_new_fearful_calm",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Speak gently. I have already heard enough harsh things today.",
      "dispositions": [
        "fearful",
        "cautious"
      ],
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_cured_recognition_warm_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember the cure like a bell under water. You were there when it rang clear.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_cured_recognition_warm_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "Whatever mercy found me, it came through your hands.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_cured_recognition_confused_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "My memory kneels and trembles. I know you, but not cleanly.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_cured_recognition_confused_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember weakness, bitterness, gold, and then breath. The rest is prayer smoke.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_cured_recognition_uneasy_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember you from the edge of a curse. Forgive me if my thanks sounds afraid.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_thunderstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The bells and prayers took the thunder badly, but everyone near my station is breathing.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_thunderstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the bells and prayers first, then the people. Both needed steady hands.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_thunderstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "That storm rattled the bells and prayers; it rattled us more.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_thunderstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Lightning makes every trade feel small. We are safe enough for now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_thunderstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I will trust the sky again when it stops threatening the roof.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_fire_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the bells and prayers for sparks. Then I checked faces for fear.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_fire_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Smoke gets into everything: lungs, clothes, and the way people talk afterward.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_fire_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "The bells and prayers can be replaced. People cannot. That is the count that matters.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_fire_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "We saved what hands could reach before the flames decided otherwise.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_fire_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Fire teaches quick priorities. Water, exits, children, neighbors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_raid_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "During a raid, the bells and prayers matters less than who makes it behind a door.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_raid_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "The horns stopped, but my hands still expect more trouble.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_raid_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "We counted survivors before supplies. That is the right order.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_raid_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "Raiders came looking for weakness. They found a village that remembers how to stand.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_raid_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "I saw fear move through the village and courage move faster.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_night_attack_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Night trouble always finds the loose latch first. We are fixing those now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_night_attack_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "I kept near the bells and prayers and listened for anyone calling for help.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_night_attack_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Dawn did not erase the attack, but it gave us light to count by.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_night_attack_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "The dark tested everyone. Most of us passed by staying alive.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_night_attack_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though every shadow is getting inspected twice.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_sandstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The bells and prayers collected half the desert, but the people made it indoors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_sandstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the bells and prayers, then checked who was coughing from the dust.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_sandstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Sand in the hinges, sand in the eyes, but no one missing so far.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_sandstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Harsh wind teaches you which doors really close.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_sandstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though the village sounds like it is grinding its teeth.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_snowstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The bells and prayers can wait. Warm hands and clear paths matter first.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_snowstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Snow piled against the doors, but everyone near me found shelter.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_snowstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Cold works quietly. We are checking on anyone who went quiet too long.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_snowstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The bells and prayers froze stiff, but the village kept moving.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_village_event_snowstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are alright for now. Keep the fires fed and the paths open.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_share_story_1",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "{target_article}. Some places gather fear the way chapels gather prayer.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_share_story_2",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "You came back from {target}. Wash your hands, clear your head, and do not carry its silence indoors.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_share_story_3",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "There are warnings that sound like stories. {target} feels like one of them.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_share_story_4",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "I will light a candle for those who wander near {target_article} without knowing better.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_share_story_5",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "Speak carefully of {target}. Names have weight when the place is hungry for attention.",
      "weight": 24
    }
  ],
  "pacify": [
    {
      "id": "cleric_pacify_success",
      "outcomes": [
        "success"
      ],
      "text": "Fine. I will breathe first and judge second.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_pacify_short",
      "outcomes": [
        "not_enough_emeralds"
      ],
      "text": "A remedy needs the full dose. Bring {emerald_cost} {emeralds}.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "cleric_pacify_blocked",
      "outcomes": [
        "blocked_by_reputation"
      ],
      "text": "No. This wound is not ready to close.",
      "weight": 26
    }
  ]
}
